{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape the Timefront</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/64e19fa51f755d3ebb0b68e9cd337942.poster.avif?t=1761604318\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/64e19fa51f755d3ebb0b68e9cd337942.webm?t=1761604318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/64e19fa51f755d3ebb0b68e9cd337942.mp4?t=1761604318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zones of the map will be progressively locked down and you will have to fight for what little resources and space is left. Will you position yourself strategically to defend to the last or will you build up your army and economy to raze everything in your path?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 races with vastly different units, commanders and buildings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snappy controls with fluid combat and smart targeting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 100 passive abilities and faction bonuses to mix-and-match and find your favorite playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps shrink progressively, locking areas of play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clash on Epic Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/b24f2f48ff8dd32c72b6bc63f0fdc0bd.poster.avif?t=1761604318\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/b24f2f48ff8dd32c72b6bc63f0fdc0bd.webm?t=1761604318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/b24f2f48ff8dd32c72b6bc63f0fdc0bd.mp4?t=1761604318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your strategies in single-player against the AI or try your luck against other players in multiplayer. Switch Commander, units, abilities and artifacts after every match to find your preferred playstyle, there are endless combinations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cinematic Campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/062eed9e2703cf4c0dcc0b9dd7addd63.poster.avif?t=1761604318\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/062eed9e2703cf4c0dcc0b9dd7addd63.webm?t=1761604318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/062eed9e2703cf4c0dcc0b9dd7addd63.mp4?t=1761604318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a rich, character-driven story and fight back against Eternity itself to reclaim the lands lost to the Timefront. This roguelite campaign will ensure replayability is fresh and engaging in every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/668742e0e3c0a5ad31559565ba1f8c9e.poster.avif?t=1761604318\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/668742e0e3c0a5ad31559565ba1f8c9e.webm?t=1761604318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/668742e0e3c0a5ad31559565ba1f8c9e.mp4?t=1761604318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Worldshaper, Timefront's game editor, to build your own custom games and publish them. If they become popular with the community, we will promote it for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist Timefront today and join the community!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3328840?t=1761604318","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3328840?t=1761604318","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/36d06f85ba44b08983d0904feba2d553be52bac4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761604318","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/36d06f85ba44b08983d0904feba2d553be52bac4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761604318","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape the Timefront</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/64e19fa51f755d3ebb0b68e9cd337942.poster.avif?t=1761604318\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/64e19fa51f755d3ebb0b68e9cd337942.webm?t=1761604318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/64e19fa51f755d3eb